---
description: UI and product copy must be English by default
alwaysApply: true
---

# English copy

- All user-facing strings (UI labels, buttons, toasts, alerts, menu items, accessibility labels, onboarding) must be **English**.
- Prefer English for new code comments and commit/PR descriptions unless the user asks otherwise.
- Do not introduce Chinese (or other non-English) UI copy unless the user explicitly requests localization.
- Brand names that are normally Latinized (e.g. Sogou) stay in English form in the UI.
